                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's fine. If you like platformers with occasional shooting, or you're interested in meta narratives but haven't played many, then you might enjoy this. Pick it up cheap or in a bundle, and make sure you enable fast-forward every time you open it.\n\nPersonally, I found the platforming finicky (granted, I play using mouse and keyboard), and the characters not half as funny or charming as the game thinks they are, which is a real problem when they interrupt the gameplay approximately every two minutes. I didn't find the meta nature of the narrative particularly compelling, either. [Redacted] was right -- I was just playing because I was curious about what would happen. Sorry, Kevin.\n\nMultiple playthroughs will most certainly unlock more information, but I've just got better things to do with my time.",
